**Displayed:**
- [What appears on screen]

**User can:**
- [Action] → Step [N] (happy path)
- [Action] → Step [N] (error path)
- [Action] → Step [N] (alternative path)

---

### Step N: [Final / Success state]

**Displayed:**
- [Confirmation, success message, next-step prompt]

**System behavior:**
- [What the system does after completion — data written, emails sent, state changes]

